# Architecture

- Feature-first: `lib/features/<feature>/{bindings,controllers,models,pages,widgets}`.
- Shared only in `lib/core` (theme, localization, storage, errors) and `lib/shared/widgets`.
- Composition root: `lib/app` + `lib/main.dart`. Core must not import features except via `app/`.
- New feature order: Model → Service/Repository → Controller → widgets → Page → Binding → `AppNavigator` method.
- SOLID: one reason to change per class; depend on abstractions (`IStorage`); keep Bindings thin (wiring only).
- Widgets have no API/business logic. Controllers have no Flutter layout.
- Do not invent folders outside this tree.
